","gloss":"agree"},{"text":"ஆது","lemma":"ஆது","gloss":"not"}],"gloss":"is it not possible"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதல்","lemma":"காதல்","gloss":"love"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"he (honorific)"}],"gloss":"lover"},{"surface":"தமக்கே","parts":[{"text":"தமக்கு","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"to themselves"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"to her"}]}],"literal":"With pollen made cool dewy doll / morning suffering helplessness avoid-saying / playmates group saying having heard / such nature pining greatly suffering / beautiful forehead sallow-color to leave such / desire-becoming quality of one word / not possible-is-it lover to her?","translation":"Even after hearing her playmates say, 'Do not grieve in the morning for the cool, dewy doll made of pollen,' she pines and suffers greatly because of her sensitive nature. To remove the sallow pallor from her beautiful forehead, is it not possible for her lover to say just one word of love?","modern":"மகரந்தத் தாதுகளால் செய்யப்பட்ட குளிர்ந்த பனிப்பாவை காலையில் சூரிய வெப்பத்தால் உருகிவிடுமே என்று வருந்தும் தன் தோழியர் கூட்டம், 'வருந்தாதே, கவலைப்படாதே' என்று கூறுவதைக் கேட்டும், தலைவி தன் மென்மையான இயல்பினால் மிகவும் வருந்துகிறாள். அவளுடைய அழகிய நெற்றியில் படர்ந்துள்ள பசலை நிறம் நீங்குமாறு, அவளுக்கு அன்பான ஒரு சொல்லைக் கூறுவது அவளுடைய காதலருக்கு இயலாத ஒன்றோ?","explanation":"The friend (tōḻi) of the heroine speaks about the heroine's delicate state during the lover's absence. She recalls how the heroine's playmates tried to comfort her when her pollen doll began to melt in the morning sun, telling her not to grieve. Yet, despite hearing their comforting words, the heroine, possessing a highly sensitive nature, continues to pine and suffer intensely. The friend laments that the lover has not sent even a single word of love or reassurance, which would easily dispel the sallow pallor (pacalai) that has spread across her beautiful forehead. This poem belongs to the pālai (wasteland/separation) landscape, where the agony of separation is compared to the melting of a delicate doll, highlighting the fragile state of the heroine's heart.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.97],[0.97,2.52],[2.52,2.76],[2.76,3.0],[3.0,3.6],[3.6,3.84],[3.84,4.1],[4.1,5.5],[5.62,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.7],[6.7,7.9],[7.9,8.4],[8.4,8.78],[8.78,9.2],[9.2,10.2],[10.2,10.8],[10.8,11.1],[11.1,11.55],[11.97,13.3],[13.3,13.7],[13.7,14.2],[14.2,15.11],[15.11,15.8],[15.8,16.3],[16.3,16.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.01],[1.01,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,3.93],[3.93,4.7],[4.7,6.0],[6.1,6.4],[6.4,6.8],[6.8,7.1],[7.1,7.84],[8.21,8.75],[8.75,8.93],[8.93,9.8],[9.8,10.8],[10.8,11.4],[11.4,11.8],[11.8,12.25],[12.68,14.1],[14.1,14.6],[14.6,15.0],[15.0,15.86],[15.86,16.5],[16.5,17.0],[17.0,17.4]]},"sync":[[["தாதின்","with pollen"]],[["செய்த","made"]],[["தண்","cool"],["பனி","dewy"],["பாவை","doll"]],[["பாவை","doll"]],[["காலை","in the morning"]],[["வருந்தும்","suffering"]],[["கையாறு","helplessness"]],[["கையாறு","helplessness"],["ஓம்பு","avoid"],["என","saying"]],[["ஓரை","play"]],[["ஆயம்","group of playmates"]],[["கூற","to say"]],[["கேட்டும்","even after hearing"]],[["இன்ன","such"]],[["பண்பின்","of nature"]],[["பண்பின்","of nature"],["இனை","pining"],["பெரிது","greatly"]],[["பெரிது","greatly"],["உழக்கும்","suffers"]],[["நல்","beautiful"],["நுதல்","forehead"]],[["பசலை","sallow pallor"]],[["நீங்க","to leave"]],[["அன்ன","such"]],[["நசையாகு","loving"]],[["பண்பின்","of quality"]],[["ஒரு","one"],["சொல்","word"]],[["இசையாது","is it not possible"]],[["கொல்லோ","indeed"]],[["காதலர்","lover"]],[["தமக்கே","to her"]]]}